5,1,1,talk,Kenji,,I want to see if we can actually finish on time! I'll check the regional firms tendering for earth-moving and the depot phasing notes on hoarding the site.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"I shall focus on the practicalities of the terrain. I will examine the drainage callouts and August heat readings, as well as the timed counts of weekday crossings.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Minato,,"I want to know who will take care of the park. I'll look into the groundskeeping roll and bought-in services, and the volunteer groups working with the division.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Minako,,I will examine the condition of works from the earlier programme and the record of the eastern avenue planting to see how previous projects have actually aged.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I am concerned about the long-term financial burden. I will review the upkeep ledger spend per hectare and the terms of the regional habitat fund.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
